+## Copilot
+
+Select `copilot` in Q6, alone or alongside Claude and Codex. Install the release ZIP
+under `.github/skills/` and invoke `/harness-bootstrap launch`.
+
+| Artifact            | Destination                       |
+| ------------------- | --------------------------------- |
+| Skills              | `.github/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`  |
+| Agents              | `.github/agents/<name>.agent.md`  |
+| Instructions        | `.github/copilot-instructions.md` |
+| Repository settings | `.github/copilot/settings.json`   |
+| MCP                 | `.mcp.json` (`mcpServers`)        |
+
+No interface selection is required. Preserve existing configuration and environment
+references. Configuration outputs sharing a path are planned once: identical
+renderings are written automatically; differing renderings or local edits require
+reconciliation. Record every provider that uses the shared output. Execute bootstrap
+using the current host's runtime procedures, independent of Q6; install the Copilot
+procedures into Copilot outputs. Verify the capabilities actually available in the session.
